<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="FATHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">FATHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">15</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov was the third son of Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov, a land owner well known in our district in his own day", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Yet she bore Fyodor Pavlovitch two sons, Ivan and Alexey, the eldest in the first year of marriage and the second three years later.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "On his arrival in the town he made no answer to his father’s first inquiry why he had come before completing his studies", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "while his father might be contemplating some piece of buffoonery. Though he said nothing, Alyosha thoroughly understood his father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "What seemed to him strangest of all was that his brother Ivan, on whom alone he had rested his hopes, and who alone had such influence on his father that he could have stopped him", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "My son, Alexey, is here, being saved. I am his father; I care for his welfare, and it is my duty to care.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Moreover, Alyosha brought with him something his father had never known before", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "Alyosha remained for some time irresolute after hearing the command his father shouted to him from the carriage.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch019", "global_index": 19, "label_ko": "3편 6장", "quote": "He did in fact find his father still at table.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "“What does Ivan say? Alyosha, my dear, my only son, I’m afraid of Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "So I am saving up more and more, simply for myself, my dear son Alexey Fyodorovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "neither Dmitri Fyodorovitch nor yourself and your brother, Alexey Fyodorovitch, would have anything after the master’s death", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "in answer to Alyosha’s question, “How can you say you’ll kill our father?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "knowing what a lot he has to do as it is, _vous comprenez, cette affaire et la mort terrible de votre papa_.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "It’s not he murdered father, not he!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">19</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch019", "global_index": 19, "label_ko": "3편 6장", "quote": "I’m so fond of him. Alyosha, let me give you my blessing—a father’s blessing.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch020", "global_index": 20, "label_ko": "3편 7장", "quote": "I love you as I do Alyosha. Don’t think I don’t love you.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="FATHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">FATHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">34</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "He was married twice, and had three sons, the eldest, Dmitri, by his first wife, and two, Ivan and Alexey, by his second.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "this Mitya, or rather Dmitri Fyodorovitch, was the only one of Fyodor Pavlovitch’s three sons who grew up in the belief that he had property", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Very shortly after getting his four-year-old Mitya off his hands Fyodor Pavlovitch married a second time.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "It was at this time that the discord between Dmitri and his father seemed at its acutest stage and their relations had become insufferably strained.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "“Precisely to our time,” cried Fyodor Pavlovitch, “but no sign of my son, Dmitri. I apologize for him, sacred elder!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "In response to Dmitri’s bow he jumped up from his chair and made his son a bow as low in return.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Adelaïda Ivanovna, the first wife of Fyodor Pavlovitch and the mother of Dmitri", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "Why, to send you to father and to her, Katerina Ivanovna, so as to have done with her and with father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "“He’s ‘insulted’ his father, not only you,” observed Ivan with a forced smile.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "even now the law does not allow you to drag your old father about by the hair, to kick him in the face in his own house", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "I am speaking of your parent and your brother Dmitri Fyodorovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "rivalry of the Karamazovs, father and son, the object of which was Grushenka", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "weighed down by all the hideous horror of his struggle with his own father for this woman, he was incapable of imagining any danger more terrible", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "When Mitya began to speak of his quarrel with his father over his inheritance, the priest was positively alarmed, as he was in some way dependent on Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "in answer to Alyosha’s question, “How can you say you’ll kill our father?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "He boasted aloud that he would kill his father; we all heard him, here.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "Ex-Lieutenant Karamazov, it is my duty to inform you that you are charged with the murder of your father, Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov, perpetrated this night....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch could have gone nowhere but to his father’s house", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch055", "global_index": 55, "label_ko": "9편 2장", "quote": "He has murdered ... his father murdered....", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "So you positively declare that you are not guilty of the death of your father, Fyodor Pavlovitch?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch057", "global_index": 57, "label_ko": "9편 4장", "quote": "Write down at once ... at once ... ‘that I snatched up the pestle to go and kill my father ... Fyodor Pavlovitch ... by hitting him on the head with it!’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "But you are your father’s son, too, you know; yet you yourself told every one you meant to murder him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "she had not loved him, but had won his heart as well as his old father’s “in my nasty spite,” that she had seen that Mitya was very jealous of Fyodor Pavlovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "Oh! not better that a son should have killed his father, I don’t defend that.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "‘Fyodor Pavlovitch, our papa,’ he said, ‘was a pig, but his ideas were right enough.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "Do you remember when Dmitri burst in after dinner and beat father, and afterwards I told you in the yard that I reserved ‘the right to desire’?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "So you thought then, you scoundrel, that together with Dmitri I meant to kill my father?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "They had already seen “the woman who had ruined Fyodor Pavlovitch and his unhappy son,”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "It wasn’t fair either of the father to wrong his son over his mother’s property, which was by right his.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "He felt quite certain that he would receive the money from his father, and spoke to me several times about it.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "suspecting that she would go to Fyodor Pavlovitch in his absence, he returned at last to the town, to find, to his joy, that she had not been near his father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "they would, in fact, have suspected the son of the murdered man, Dmitri Fyodorovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "After that he had no prospect of getting it from any one; his father would not give it him after that beating.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "but it’s not true that I killed my father, the prosecutor is mistaken.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">11</data>
  <data key="d8">5</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "You wanted to put me in prison because you are jealous of me with her, because you’d begun to force your attentions upon her; and I know all about that, too", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "see for yourself, which she means to choose, him or me. Eh? What? Can you?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "many in our town knew of the grotesque and monstrous rivalry of the Karamazovs, father and son, the object of which was Grushenka", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "A horrible fury of hatred suddenly surged up in Mitya’s heart: “There he was, his rival, the man who had tormented him, had ruined his life!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "on the contrary, the latter heard that he meant to use this sum to seduce the woman he, the prisoner, loved.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">37</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "‘My father still owes me just three thousand,’ he said.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "In fact, he might reckon on an additional sum of six or even seven thousand roubles from Fyodor Pavlovitch", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "In reply to the prosecutor’s question what grounds he had for asserting that Fyodor Pavlovitch had wronged his son in their money relations, Grigory, to the surprise of every one, had no proof", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="FATHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">FATHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">20</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "He was married twice, and had three sons, the eldest, Dmitri, by his first wife, and two, Ivan and Alexey, by his second.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Yet she bore Fyodor Pavlovitch two sons, Ivan and Alexey, the eldest in the first year of marriage and the second three years later.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "It must be noted that he was not, like Ivan, staying with his father, but living apart at the other end of the town.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch006", "global_index": 6, "label_ko": "2편 1장", "quote": "In an ancient, jolting, but roomy, hired carriage, with a pair of old pinkish-gray horses, a long way behind Miüsov’s carriage, came Fyodor Pavlovitch, with his son Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "his brother Ivan, on whom alone he had rested his hopes, and who alone had such influence on his father that he could have stopped him", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "“Most pious and holy elder,” he cried, pointing to Ivan, “that is my son, flesh of my flesh, the dearest of my flesh!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "and begged me, and his son Ivan Fyodorovitch, to convey to you his apologies and regrets.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "But at the time of our story there was no one living in the house but Fyodor Pavlovitch and his son Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch020", "global_index": 20, "label_ko": "3편 7장", "quote": "Ivan listened with perfect seriousness to his father’s excited whisper.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "“Why do you run after him? He’ll murder you outright,” Ivan cried wrathfully at his father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "I am speaking of your parent and your brother Dmitri Fyodorovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "watched his son going upstairs, till he passed out of sight.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "‘Fyodor Pavlovitch, our papa,’ he said, ‘was a pig, but his ideas were right enough.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "It was you, you who persuaded me that he murdered his father. It’s only you I believed!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "foreseeing such a calamity you deserted your own father, and would not protect us, for I might have been taken up any time for stealing that three thousand.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "So you thought then, you scoundrel, that together with Dmitri I meant to kill my father?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "revealing your eagerness for your father’s death, and I tell you the public would have believed it all", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "to confess you murdered your father, that the valet murdered him at your instigation.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "If there is one of the sons that is like Fyodor Pavlovitch in character, it is Ivan Fyodorovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "philosophical conversations with his master’s elder son, Ivan Fyodorovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">20</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch020", "global_index": 20, "label_ko": "3편 7장", "quote": "I love you as I do Alyosha. Don’t think I don’t love you.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">21</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch021", "global_index": 21, "label_ko": "3편 8장", "quote": "The old man persisted. He had reached that state of drunkenness when the drunkard who has till then been inoffensive tries to pick a quarrel and to assert himself.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Adelaïda Ivanovna" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "It is known for a fact that frequent fights took place between the husband and wife, but rumor had it that Fyodor Pavlovitch did not beat his wife but was beaten by her", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Adelaïda Ivanovna" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "Fyodor Pavlovitch, who, as is now known, got hold of all her money up to twenty-five thousand roubles as soon as she received it, so that those thousands were lost to her for ever.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Odessa" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">4</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "Three or four years after his wife’s death he had gone to the south of Russia and finally turned up in Odessa, where he spent several years.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">7</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "What do I care for your faith?” Miüsov was on the point of shouting, but he suddenly checked himself, and said with contempt, “You defile everything you touch.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch010", "global_index": 10, "label_ko": "2편 5장", "quote": "He had been waiting for some time to pay off old scores, and now he could not let the opportunity slip. Bending over his shoulder he began teasing him again in a whisper.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "“Pyotr Alexandrovitch here blames me too. You have been blaming me, Pyotr Alexandrovitch, you have!” he turned suddenly to Miüsov", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">11</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "I’ll eat at home, I don’t feel equal to it here, Pyotr Alexandrovitch, my amiable relative.” “I am not your relative and never have been, you contemptible man!”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "You stung him by what you said about family harmony, Father Superior, he does not admit he is my relation.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="I.O.U.'s" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">11</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "suggested to her from you, that she should take I.O.U.’s of mine which were in your possession, and should sue me for the money so as to get me into prison by means of them", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Father Superior" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">13</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "Holy Father, I am indignant with you.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazovs' house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "But at the time of our story there was no one living in the house but Fyodor Pavlovitch and his son Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Smerdyakov" id="FATHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">FATHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">15</data>
  <data key="d8">5</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch015", "global_index": 15, "label_ko": "3편 2장", "quote": "Then suddenly a terrible rumor was all over the town that this miscreant was no other than Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "Why, he’s very likely his son, you know—his natural son. Do you know that?” “We have heard that legend.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "formerly the servant, and possibly the illegitimate son, of Fyodor Pavlovitch, Smerdyakov.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "reckless life of his master, who was also perhaps his father—Fyodor Pavlovitch;", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "Believing himself to be the illegitimate son of Fyodor Pavlovitch (there is evidence of this)", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 6}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Smerdyakov" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">21</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch021", "global_index": 21, "label_ko": "3편 8장", "quote": "I’ll send you the gold piece I promised you to-day, but be off!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Marfa Ignatyevna" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">38</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "To her master’s bitter, though deserved, reproaches, Marfa Ignatyevna replied that the fowl was a very old one to begin with", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Grushenka" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">38</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "Fyodor Pavlovitch had much to think of, but never had his heart been steeped in such voluptuous hopes.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "Fyodor Pavlovitch, who first came into contact with Grushenka over a piece of speculation, ended to his own surprise by falling madly in love with her", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "“Grushenka, is it you? Is it you?” he said, in a sort of trembling half-whisper. “Where are you, my angel, where are you?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch055", "global_index": 55, "label_ko": "9편 2장", "quote": "A present of three thousand roubles for my angel Grushenka, if she is willing to come.” And below had been added by Fyodor Pavlovitch, “For my little chicken.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "she had not loved him, but had won his heart as well as his old father’s", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "he was awfully crazy about her—and he leaned right out of the window.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "wondered how father and son could be so in love with “such a very common, ordinary Russian girl, who was not even pretty.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "At the same time the prisoner’s father was captivated by the same young person—a strange and fatal coincidence, for they both lost their hearts to her simultaneously, though both had known her before.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Grushenka" id="ENGAGED_TO">
  <data key="d6">ENGAGED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">46</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "he was firmly persuaded that Fyodor Pavlovitch would offer, or perhaps had offered, Grushenka lawful wedlock", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch’s house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">37</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "And Ivan, on parting from Alyosha, went home to Fyodor Pavlovitch’s house.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "All Fyodor Pavlovitch’s bedroom lay open before him. It was not a large room, and was divided in two parts by a red screen", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "The most direct and the easiest thing for him to do would have been to go straight to Fyodor Pavlovitch’s", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch055", "global_index": 55, "label_ko": "9편 2장", "quote": "old Fyodor Pavlovitch really had been murdered that evening in his own house, murdered and robbed.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">77</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "I swung it and hit him on the top of the skull with the corner of it. He didn’t even cry out.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="White silk dressing-gown" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">80</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "On it lay Fyodor Pavlovitch’s white silk dressing-gown, stained with blood;", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Envelope with three thousand roubles" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">83</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "had only heard from “that wicked wretch” that Fyodor Pavlovitch had an envelope with notes for three thousand in it.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov" id="FATHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">FATHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">90</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "as he expected to receive shortly from his father the three thousand roubles that he reckoned was owing to him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "suppose for one moment I agreed with the prosecution that my luckless client had stained his hands with his father’s blood.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">90</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "on the contrary, the latter heard that he meant to use this sum to seduce the woman he, the prisoner, loved.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">90</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "as he expected to receive shortly from his father the three thousand roubles that he reckoned was owing to him.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="3000 Roubles" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">91</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "He told me himself that he had helped Fyodor Pavlovitch to put the notes in the envelope.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="The Karamazovs' house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "there was no one living in the house but Fyodor Pavlovitch and his son Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Three thousand roubles" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">37</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "Fyodor Pavlovitch has a big envelope with three thousand roubles in it, tied up with ribbon and sealed with three seals.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov family" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">81</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "he had been everywhere, seen everything, talked to everybody, knew every detail of the biography of Fyodor Pavlovitch and all the Karamazovs.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "What, after all, is this Karamazov family, which has gained such an unenviable notoriety throughout Russia?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "Could a Karamazov fail to understand it? That anxiety was just what he was suffering from—what is there improbable in his laying aside that money and concealing it in case of emergency?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" target="Madame Svyetlov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">90</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "Then why not imagine that old Fyodor Pavlovitch, locked up alone in impatient and hysterical expectation of the object of his adoration, may have whiled away the time", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">20</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "He was married twice, and had three sons, the eldest, Dmitri, by his first wife, and two, Ivan and Alexey, by his second.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Yet she bore Fyodor Pavlovitch two sons, Ivan and Alexey, the eldest in the first year of marriage and the second three years later.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "He was only twenty, his brother Ivan was in his twenty-fourth year at the time, while their elder brother Dmitri was twenty-seven.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "He more quickly made friends with his half-brother Dmitri (though he arrived later) than with his own brother Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "his brother Ivan, on whom alone he had rested his hopes, and who alone had such influence on his father that he could have stopped him", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "If even you are a sensualist at heart, what of your brother, Ivan? He’s a Karamazov, too.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch021", "global_index": 21, "label_ko": "3편 8장", "quote": "“Don’t be ill-tempered with my brother. Leave off attacking him,” Alyosha said emphatically.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "he remembered that his father had insisted the day before that he should come without his brother Ivan seeing him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "During the preceding month it had been several times suggested to him that his brother Ivan was in love with Katerina Ivanovna", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "A minute later Alyosha was sitting beside his brother. Ivan was alone dining.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "There’s such a difference between fifteen and eleven that brothers are never companions at those ages.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch035", "global_index": 35, "label_ko": "5편 4장", "quote": "“Brother, what are you driving at?” asked Alyosha.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 7}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "He waited a little, looking after his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "neither Dmitri Fyodorovitch nor yourself and your brother, Alexey Fyodorovitch, would have anything after the master’s death", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "By the way, your brother Ivan set off to Moscow this morning, did you know?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "as they met, he recognized him as his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "Alyosha turned rather pale, and looked silently into his brother’s face.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch078", "global_index": 78, "label_ko": "11편 9장", "quote": "There’s a snowstorm and he is your brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "“Brother,” he cried suddenly, “you must be terribly ill. You look and don’t seem to understand what I tell you.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch094", "global_index": 94, "label_ko": "13편 1장", "quote": "Alyosha came to see his sick brother twice a day.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">34</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "You seem to love me for some reason, Alyosha?” “I do love you, Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">36</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "“But ... that’s absurd!” he cried, flushing. “Your poem is in praise of Jesus, not in blame of Him—as you meant it to be.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">5</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "He only sent word the day before, through a friend, to his brother Dmitri, that he loved him and expected him to keep his promise.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "And your Mitya will squelch too. _Your_ Mitya, for you love him. Yes, you love him and I am not afraid of your loving him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "ascribed his opinion only to his exaggerated brotherly feeling and sympathy with Mitya, of whom Alyosha, as Ivan knew, was very fond.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">23</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "At her death almost exactly the same thing happened to the two little boys as to their elder brother, Mitya.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "He was only twenty, his brother Ivan was in his twenty-fourth year at the time, while their elder brother Dmitri was twenty-seven.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "He more quickly made friends with his half-brother Dmitri (though he arrived later) than with his own brother Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "That bowing to your brother, Dmitri. And didn’t he tap the ground with his forehead, too!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "He had a great longing to run and see his brother Dmitri before that fateful interview.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch017", "global_index": 17, "label_ko": "3편 4장", "quote": "I am speaking figuratively, brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "“Brother, what are you saying?” “Oh, I don’t know.... I don’t know. Perhaps I shan’t kill, and perhaps I shall.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch023", "global_index": 23, "label_ko": "3편 10장", "quote": "How would things end between his father and his brother Dmitri with this terrible woman?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch024", "global_index": 24, "label_ko": "3편 11장", "quote": "Nothing, brother—it’s the fright you gave me. Oh, Dmitri! Father’s blood just now.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch030", "global_index": 30, "label_ko": "4편 6장", "quote": "So your boy is a good boy, he loves his father, and he attacked me as the brother of your assailant.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch031", "global_index": 31, "label_ko": "4편 7장", "quote": "That same brother of mine, Dmitri, has insulted his betrothed, too, a noble-hearted girl of whom you have probably heard.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "the thought had struck him that he must attempt some stratagem to find his brother Dmitri, who was evidently keeping out of his way.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "how he could on leaving Ivan so completely forget his brother Dmitri", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "He remembered afterwards how, on that terrible day, he had entirely forgotten his brother Dmitri, about whom he had been so anxious and troubled the day before", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "Alyosha, give my greetings to your brother Mitya and tell him not to remember evil against me", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "that new doctor Katya sent for from Moscow for your unhappy brother, who will to-morrow—But why speak of to-morrow?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch072", "global_index": 72, "label_ko": "11편 3장", "quote": "“Go to your brother, the prison will be shut; go, here’s your hat. Give my love to Mitya, go, go!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "Yes, the trial’s to-morrow. Are you so hopeless, brother?” Alyosha said, with an apprehensive feeling.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 8}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "ascribed his opinion only to his exaggerated brotherly feeling and sympathy with Mitya, of whom Alyosha, as Ivan knew, was very fond.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "Alyosha gave his evidence modestly and with restraint, but his warm sympathy for his unhappy brother was unmistakable.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "He sent his younger brother to beg for the last time for the three thousand roubles", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch095", "global_index": 95, "label_ko": "13편 2장", "quote": "It’s hard for her, you know,” Alyosha looked timidly at his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch096", "global_index": 96, "label_ko": "13편 3장", "quote": "“The valet killed him, my brother is innocent,” answered Alyosha.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lise" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">9</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch009", "global_index": 9, "label_ko": "2편 4장", "quote": "He used to come to teach me to read, do you know.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lise" id="ENGAGED_TO">
  <data key="d6">ENGAGED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">28</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "when you reach the legal age we will be married. I shall love you.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch032", "global_index": 32, "label_ko": "5편 1장", "quote": "He has chosen me as his wife and is quite settled about it. He is sure I was in earnest.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "Ever since Lise took back her promise—her childish promise, Alexey Fyodorovitch—to marry you, you’ve realized, of course, that it was only the playful fancy of a sick child", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lise" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">28</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "when you reach the legal age we will be married. I shall love you.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch072", "global_index": 72, "label_ko": "11편 3장", "quote": "“But I do love you!” answered Alyosha warmly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov family" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "You’re a Karamazov too, you know! In your family sensuality is carried to a disease.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "All we Karamazovs are such insects, and, angel as you are, that insect lives in you, too, and will stir up a tempest in your blood.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch031", "global_index": 31, "label_ko": "4편 7장", "quote": "He was avenging you on me as a Karamazov, I see that now.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch032", "global_index": 32, "label_ko": "5편 1장", "quote": "Ah, you don’t know, but I, too, am a Karamazov.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "Madame Svyetlov was particularly anxious a couple of months ago to make the acquaintance of the younger Karamazov, Alexey Fyodorovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "Why, why does the prosecutor refuse to believe the evidence of Alexey Karamazov, given so genuinely and sincerely, so spontaneously and convincingly?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazovs" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "Where can you have heard it? You Karamazovs brag of being an ancient, noble family", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "All we Karamazovs are such insects, and, angel as you are, that insect lives in you, too", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "It’s a feature of the Karamazovs, it’s true, that thirst for life regardless of everything; you have it no doubt too", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "what wild rumors about his brother, about the Karamazovs, and about himself he had read in the course of those two months", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="letter from Madame Hohlakov" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">23</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch023", "global_index": 23, "label_ko": "3편 10장", "quote": "Alyosha took the little pink envelope mechanically and put it, almost unconsciously, into his pocket.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Father Zossima" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">25</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch025", "global_index": 25, "label_ko": "4편 1장", "quote": "To you, dear son, because you love me. But now go to keep your promise.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "what he saw before all was one figure—the figure of his beloved elder, the figure of that holy man whom he revered with such adoration.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov's manuscript" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">41</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch041", "global_index": 41, "label_ko": "6편 3장", "quote": "Here Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov’s manuscript ends.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Hermitage Garden" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">42</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch042", "global_index": 42, "label_ko": "7편 1장", "quote": "he at once noticed him in the farthest corner of the hermitage garden, sitting on the tombstone of a monk", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Rakitin" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">43</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "Once you, too, could not resist letting me know I was ‘dishonorable.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="the Monastery" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">10</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Yes, he had been for the last year in our monastery, and seemed willing to be cloistered there for the rest of his life.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "My son, Alexey, is here, being saved. I am his father; I care for his welfare, and it is my duty to care.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "Alyosha told Ivan that their father had waked up, was conscious, and had let him go back to sleep at the monastery.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch025", "global_index": 25, "label_ko": "4편 1장", "quote": "As Alyosha left the monastery and thought them over, he suddenly realized that he had met a new and unexpected friend", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "Alexey Fyodorovitch, don’t trouble to come and see me afterwards, but go straight back to your monastery and a good riddance.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "even should he be unable to return to the monastery that night.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "And a whole year of life in the monastery had formed the habit of this expectation in his heart.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "“It’s time we were off,” he said, “it’s late, we shall be shut out of the monastery.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch045", "global_index": 45, "label_ko": "7편 4장", "quote": "Within three days he left the monastery in accordance with the words of his elder, who had bidden him “sojourn in the world.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch068", "global_index": 68, "label_ko": "10편 6장", "quote": "I have heard you are a mystic and have been in the monastery. I know you are a mystic, but ... that hasn’t put me off.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Grushenka" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">44</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "Why, are you in love with her? Agrafena Alexandrovna, our monk’s really in love with you, you’ve made a conquest!”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 6}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="the Hermitage" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">42</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch042", "global_index": 42, "label_ko": "7편 1장", "quote": "“Are you leaving the hermitage? What, without asking leave, without asking a blessing?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch045", "global_index": 45, "label_ko": "7편 4장", "quote": "It was very late, according to the monastery ideas, when Alyosha returned to the hermitage; the door-keeper let him in by a special entrance.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Nikolay Krassotkin" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">69</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch069", "global_index": 69, "label_ko": "10편 7장", "quote": "“There is only one man in the world who can command Nikolay Krassotkin—this is the man”; Kolya pointed to Alyosha.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="letter to Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">72</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch072", "global_index": 72, "label_ko": "11편 3장", "quote": "he was suddenly aware of a letter in his right hand, a tiny letter folded up tight and sealed.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lise's letter" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">32</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch032", "global_index": 32, "label_ko": "5편 1장", "quote": "The letter is with me now, and it was this morning, in this pocket. Here it is.” Alyosha pulled the letter out laughing, and showed it her at a distance.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "“Oh, while I think of it, I have a letter for you,” said Alyosha timidly, and he took Lise’s note from his pocket and held it out to Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ilusha's funeral" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">96</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch096", "global_index": 96, "label_ko": "13편 3장", "quote": "After the Epistle he suddenly whispered to Alyosha, who was standing beside him, that the Epistle had not been read properly", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ilusha's Funeral" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">96</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch096", "global_index": 96, "label_ko": "13편 3장", "quote": "when we recall how we buried Ilusha, how we loved him in his last days", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="note from Katerina Ivanovna" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">16</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "“Here is her note.” Alyosha took it out of his pocket.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Schoolboys' stone fight" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">27</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch027", "global_index": 27, "label_ko": "4편 3장", "quote": "Both sides threw stones incessantly. Many of the group had their pockets full too. “What are you about! Aren’t you ashamed? Six against one! Why, you’ll kill him,” cried Alyosha.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Handkerchief" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">27</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch027", "global_index": 27, "label_ko": "4편 3장", "quote": "Alyosha took out his handkerchief and bound it tightly round his injured hand.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Kolya Krassotkin" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">66</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch066", "global_index": 66, "label_ko": "10편 4장", "quote": "I’ve come to learn of you, Karamazov,” Kolya concluded, in a voice full of spontaneous feeling.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna's note" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">16</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "“Here is her note.” Alyosha took it out of his pocket. Mitya looked through it quickly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">13</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "He was married twice, and had three sons, the eldest, Dmitri, by his first wife, and two, Ivan and Alexey, by his second.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "At her death almost exactly the same thing happened to the two little boys as to their elder brother, Mitya.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "From him Alyosha learnt all the details of the important affair which had of late formed such a close and remarkable bond between the two elder brothers.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "while this son who has just come in, Dmitri, against whom I am seeking justice from you, is the undutiful Franz Moor", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "cried out aloud that he was unworthy of his betrothed, Katya, but that his brother Ivan, he was the man who deserved her.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch017", "global_index": 17, "label_ko": "3편 4장", "quote": "You’re the first, except Ivan, of course—Ivan knows everything.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "I am speaking of your parent and your brother Dmitri Fyodorovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "he heard with interest, too, that his brother Ivan had set off that morning for Moscow.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "Though I say that Ivan is superior to us, you are my angel.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "By the way, let us say a word or two of Ivan’s feeling to his brother Dmitri.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "he wanted to save his brother and he confessed.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch084", "global_index": 84, "label_ko": "12편 5장", "quote": "Mitya stood up and greedily looked at his brother and listened to him with a wild, strange smile.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "While his brothers seem to stand for ‘Europeanism’ and ‘the principles of the people,’ he seems to represent Russia as she is.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">75</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "He even succeeded in insulting Ivan during their first interview, telling him sharply that it was not for people who declared that “everything was lawful,” to suspect and question him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">29</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "Dmitri had said outright on the previous day that he was glad that Ivan was his rival, and that it was a great assistance to him, Dmitri.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">9</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "he had received the whole value of his property in sums of money from Fyodor Pavlovitch, and was perhaps even in debt to him", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "while Dmitri Fyodorovitch is in debt to me, and not a little, but some thousands of which I have documentary proof.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "my disputes with my father, Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov, who robbed me of my inheritance from my mother", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "When Mitya began to speak of his quarrel with his father over his inheritance, the priest was positively alarmed, as he was in some way dependent on Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "“Hasn’t he robbed his old father?—that’s the question.”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "“Disputes about money?” “Yes, about money, too.” “There was a dispute about three thousand roubles, I think, which you", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "and had even bragged aloud before every one that he’d go and take his property from Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "He felt quite certain that he would receive the money from his father, and spoke to me several times about it. I knew he had a feud with his father", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "that very three thousand roubles, which the son looked upon as his own property, part of his inheritance from his mother, of which his father was cheating him.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">21</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "He seems not to have liked his father. He did not stay long with him, and made haste to get away", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "his elder brother Dmitri, who was in open quarrel with his father and even planning to bring an action against him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "It was at this time that the discord between Dmitri and his father seemed at its acutest stage and their relations had become insufferably strained.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "as well as of the violent anger to which he had been roused in his quarrels with his father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "But Dmitri threw up both hands and suddenly clutched the old man by the two tufts of hair that remained on his temples, tugged at them, and flung him with a crash on the floor.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "even now the law does not allow you to drag your old father about by the hair, to kick him in the face in his own house, and brag of murdering him outright—all in the presence of witnesses.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "For him the whole tormenting question lay between him and Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "When Mitya began to speak of his quarrel with his father over his inheritance, the priest was positively alarmed, as he was in some way dependent on Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "A horrible fury of hatred suddenly surged up in Mitya’s heart: “There he was, his rival, the man who had tormented him, had ruined his life!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "He boasted aloud that he would kill his father; we all heard him, here.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "And the very same day, in the evening I beat my father. I nearly killed him, and I swore I’d come again and kill him, before witnesses....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch057", "global_index": 57, "label_ko": "9편 4장", "quote": "Write down at once ... at once ... ‘that I snatched up the pestle to go and kill my father ... Fyodor Pavlovitch ... by hitting him on the head with it!’", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "seeing his father peering out of the window, his hatred flared up and he pulled the pestle out of his pocket", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "“Did he never say before you ... casually, or in a moment of irritation,” Nikolay Parfenovitch put in suddenly, “that he intended to make an attempt on his father’s life?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "Do you remember when Dmitri burst in after dinner and beat father, and afterwards I told you in the yard that I reserved ‘the right to desire’?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "But I am not guilty of the death of that old man, my enemy and my father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "Grigory’s description of the scene at the dinner-table, when Dmitri had burst in and beaten his father, threatening to come back to kill him", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "I knew he had a feud with his father and have always believed that he had been unfairly treated by his father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "horrible scene of violence when the prisoner had rushed into his father’s house just after dinner.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "Remember the phrase in Dmitri Karamazov’s drunken letter, ‘I shall kill the old man, if only Ivan goes away.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "burst in himself and ended by beating the old man in the presence of witnesses.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">22</data>
  <data key="d8">7</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "see for yourself, which she means to choose, him or me. Eh? What? Can you?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "although many in our town knew of the grotesque and monstrous rivalry of the Karamazovs, father and son, the object of which was Grushenka", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "weighed down by all the hideous horror of his struggle with his own father for this woman, he was incapable of imagining any danger more terrible", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "A horrible fury of hatred suddenly surged up in Mitya’s heart: “There he was, his rival, the man who had tormented him, had ruined his life!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "she had not loved him, but had won his heart as well as his old father’s “in my nasty spite,” that she had seen that Mitya was very jealous of Fyodor Pavlovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "when he knelt before her, stretching out hands that were already stained with the blood of his father and rival.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "Most likely he killed him in anger, burning with resentment, as soon as he looked on his hated rival.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">28</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "He was married twice, and had three sons, the eldest, Dmitri, by his first wife, and two, Ivan and Alexey, by his second.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "At her death almost exactly the same thing happened to the two little boys as to their elder brother, Mitya.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "his brother Ivan was in his twenty-fourth year at the time, while their elder brother Dmitri was twenty-seven.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "He more quickly made friends with his half-brother Dmitri (though he arrived later) than with his own brother Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "And by the way, do you remember how your brother Mitya cried out: ‘I will remember!’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "Dmitri led his brother to the most secluded corner of the garden.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch017", "global_index": 17, "label_ko": "3편 4장", "quote": "Once I was bitten by a centipede, brother, and laid up a fortnight with fever from it.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "“There’s something in it, brother, that no woman could forgive. Do you know what would be the best thing to do?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "“Shouldn’t you put a wet bandage on your head and go to bed, too?” Alyosha said to him. “We’ll look after him. My brother gave you a terrible blow—on the head.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch023", "global_index": 23, "label_ko": "3편 10장", "quote": "Towering like a mountain above all the rest stood the fatal, insoluble question: How would things end between his father and his brother Dmitri with this terrible woman?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch024", "global_index": 24, "label_ko": "3편 11장", "quote": "Here he is, that man, my dear little brother, whom I love more than any one in the world, the only one I love in the world.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "And your brother Dmitri Fyodorovitch, what do you think of him?—my goodness!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "He loved both his brothers, and dreaded such rivalry between them.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch030", "global_index": 30, "label_ko": "4편 6장", "quote": "his brother Dmitri lived close by, in a turning out of Lake Street.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch031", "global_index": 31, "label_ko": "4편 7장", "quote": "Well, your brother Dmitri Fyodorovitch was pulling me by my beard, I’d done nothing, he was in a towering rage and happened to come upon me.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "the thought had struck him that he must attempt some stratagem to find his brother Dmitri, who was evidently keeping out of his way.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "Several times afterwards he wondered how he could on leaving Ivan so completely forget his brother Dmitri", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "He remembered afterwards how, on that terrible day, he had entirely forgotten his brother Dmitri, about whom he had been so anxious and troubled the day before", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "I am afraid of your brother Mitya to-day, Alyosha.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "After parting from his brother on that night, he had felt in his frenzy that it would be better", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "in answer to Alyosha’s question, “How can you say you’ll kill our father?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "I didn’t dare even to tell Alyosha, my brother, about that fifteen hundred: I felt I was such a scoundrel", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "It’s very important for me to be in time to see my brother to-day,” Alyosha faltered.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch072", "global_index": 72, "label_ko": "11편 3장", "quote": "I sent your brother, Dmitri Fyodorovitch, some sweets in prison.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "Rakitin explained it all to me yesterday, brother, and it simply bowled me over.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 7}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "I was led to do so by my brother Dmitri’s words.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch095", "global_index": 95, "label_ko": "13편 2장", "quote": "He looked sometimes with a face of suffering at his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch096", "global_index": 96, "label_ko": "13편 3장", "quote": "“Is your brother innocent or guilty? Was it he killed your father or was it the valet? As you say, so it will be.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">16</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "I could take you in my arms, Alyosha, and press you to my bosom till I crush you, for in the whole world—in reality—in re-al-i-ty—(can you take it in?) I love no one but you!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch024", "global_index": 24, "label_ko": "3편 11장", "quote": "Here he is, that man, my dear little brother, whom I love more than any one in the world, the only one I love in the world.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "Damn ethics, I am done for, Alexey, I am, you man of God! I love you more than any one.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna" id="ENGAGED_TO">
  <data key="d6">ENGAGED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "Since he has openly abandoned his betrothed for her, he doesn’t despise her.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "Yes, formally and solemnly betrothed. It was all done on my arrival in Moscow, with great ceremony", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch023", "global_index": 23, "label_ko": "3편 10장", "quote": "his brother besought and insisted that he should not conceal his impressions on seeing his betrothed.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "Is that betrothed of his, Katerina Ivanovna, whom he has kept so carefully hidden from me all this time, going to marry him or not?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch031", "global_index": 31, "label_ko": "4편 7장", "quote": "That same brother of mine, Dmitri, has insulted his betrothed, too, a noble-hearted girl of whom you have probably heard.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "She had detested him from the first because he was engaged to Katerina Ivanovna", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "You see, a month ago, I was sent for by Katerina Ivanovna, formerly my betrothed.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "Katerina Ivanovna replied firmly that she had been formerly betrothed to the prisoner", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">17</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch017", "global_index": 17, "label_ko": "3편 4장", "quote": "But, on my oath, I looked at her for three seconds, or five perhaps, with fearful hatred—that hate which is only a hair’s-breadth from love, from the maddest love!", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "So he loves her, if he’ll praise her to my face, more shame to him!", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch084", "global_index": 84, "label_ko": "12편 5장", "quote": "I swear, I swear I loved you even while I hated you, and you didn’t love me!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch095", "global_index": 95, "label_ko": "13편 2장", "quote": "do you know, five days ago, that same evening, I loved you.... When you fell down and were carried out", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">18</data>
  <data key="d8">11</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "What, do you suppose I’d shoot myself because I can’t get three thousand to pay back?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch023", "global_index": 23, "label_ko": "3편 10장", "quote": "trying to think how to prevent him from being ashamed to face me because he spent that three thousand.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "for the money of Katerina Ivanovna that he had dishonestly appropriated.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "three thousand that would pay his debt to Katerina Ivanovna", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "Grusha, you wanted to be honest, but I’m a thief. But I’ve stolen money from Katya.... Disgrace, a disgrace!", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "Many people have already guessed, during this last month, about the three thousand of Katerina Ivanovna’s, that you have spent", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "and that she had replied to that that he hadn’t stolen it, and that he must pay the money back next day.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "FATAL KATYA: To-morrow I will get the money and repay your three thousand and farewell, woman of great wrath, but farewell, too, my love!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "when he had the means of repaying Katerina Ivanovna half (half, note!) what he owed her, he yet could not bring himself to repay the money", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch084", "global_index": 84, "label_ko": "12편 5장", "quote": "He hated me at that time, because he had behaved contemptibly and was running after that creature ... and because he owed me that three thousand....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "‘If Fyodor Pavlovitch doesn’t give the money,’ he thought, ‘I shall be put in the position of a thief before Katerina Ivanovna.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">24</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch024", "global_index": 24, "label_ko": "3편 11장", "quote": "Brother, you don’t seem to have noticed how you’ve insulted Katerina Ivanovna by telling Grushenka about that day.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch031", "global_index": 31, "label_ko": "4편 7장", "quote": "That same brother of mine, Dmitri, has insulted his betrothed, too, a noble-hearted girl of whom you have probably heard.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch084", "global_index": 84, "label_ko": "12편 5장", "quote": "We’ve hated each other for many things, Katya, but I swear, I swear I loved you even while I hated you, and you didn’t love me!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "Katya, I forgive you! Brothers, friends, have pity on the other woman!", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Grushenka" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">23</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "Since he has openly abandoned his betrothed for her, he doesn’t despise her.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "I’ll be her husband if she deigns to have me, and when lovers come, I’ll go into the next room.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "Of late, when Dmitri too had come on the scene with his love, the old man left off laughing.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch046", "global_index": 46, "label_ko": "8편 1장", "quote": "terrible as it was to him to lose sight of Grushenka for a moment.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "But the thought of her was stabbing him to the heart every moment, like a sharp knife. At last they arrived, and Mitya at once ran to Grushenka.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "in his love for the woman, there was an element of something far higher than he himself imagined", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch051", "global_index": 51, "label_ko": "8편 6장", "quote": "for I love the queen of my soul ... I love her and I cannot help loving her.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch052", "global_index": 52, "label_ko": "8편 7장", "quote": "I wanted to spend my last day, my last hour in this room, in this very room ... where I, too, adored ... my queen....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "He jumped up and ran back to the room—to her, to her, his queen for ever! Was not one moment of her love worth all the rest of life, even in the agonies of disgrace?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "“Grusha, my life, my blood, my holy one!” Mitya fell on his knees beside her and held her tight in his arms.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch057", "global_index": 57, "label_ko": "9편 4장", "quote": "give a minute account of the agonies of jealousy he endured on Grushenka’s account.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "when I’d just come to love another, her, she’s sitting down below now, Grushenka.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "though “at times” she had thought him attractive, she had not loved him, but had won his heart as well as his old father’s", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch062", "global_index": 62, "label_ko": "9편 9장", "quote": "Forgive me, Grusha, for my love, for ruining you, too, with my love.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "He loves you, that’s what it is: he loves you so much. And now he is particularly worried.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "Grusha’s killing me; the thought of her’s killing me, killing me. She was with me just now....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "Better Siberia than your love, for I love another woman and you got to know her too well to-day, so how can you forgive?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "wondered how father and son could be so in love with “such a very common, ordinary Russian girl, who was not even pretty.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "through his passion for Grushenka and his rivalry with his father, his brother had been of late in an intolerable position.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "Here Ippolit Kirillovitch described at length the prisoner’s fatal passion for Grushenka.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "She will remember Mitya Karamazov sometimes, she will see how Mitya loved her, she will feel for Mitya!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "on the contrary, the latter heard that he meant to use this sum to seduce the woman he, the prisoner, loved.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch095", "global_index": 95, "label_ko": "13편 2장", "quote": "“Alyosha, I love Grusha terribly,” he said suddenly in a shaking voice, full of tears.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Grushenka" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">18</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "You see, I went in the first place to beat her.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "she received Dmitri Fyodorovitch simply from fear because “he threatened to murder her.”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "He’s treated me badly himself, so he attacked me, to make out I am in fault first and to throw it all on me.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "“She told me she was very much grieved by you to-day.” “I know. Confound my temper! It was jealousy.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Grushenka" id="ENGAGED_TO">
  <data key="d6">ENGAGED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">18</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "Grushenka is really perhaps not joking, and really means to marry me.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "Gentlemen, she is my betrothed!” he said ecstatically and reverently, looking round at them all.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazovs" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">16</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "For I’m a Karamazov. For when I do leap into the pit, I go headlong with my heels up", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "and he wanted to do it at once, at once, regardless of all obstacles, with all the recklessness of the Karamazovs.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "The Karamazovs are not blackguards, but philosophers; for all true Russians are philosophers", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "Here we see in excess a love of effect, a romantic despair and sentimentality, and the wild recklessness of the Karamazovs.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Grigory" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">22</data>
  <data key="d8">12</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "Beside himself with fury, Dmitri struck out, and hit Grigory with all his might.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "He remembered afterwards clearly, that he had been awfully anxious to make sure whether he had broken the old man’s skull, or simply stunned him with the pestle.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "I am guilty of the blood of another old man but not of my father’s. And I weep for it! I killed, I killed the old man and knocked him down....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch057", "global_index": 57, "label_ko": "9편 4장", "quote": "I can’t expect you to pat me on the head for what I did to Grigory, for one can’t break old men’s heads with impunity.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "Scarcely had Mitya described how, sitting on the wall, he had struck Grigory on the head with the pestle", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "given us by Grigory, the old man you wounded.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "When he recovered from the blow Dmitri Fyodorovitch gave him on the head, he was suffering from aberration; he went and committed the murder.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "Grigory’s my enemy. And there are some people who are better as foes than friends.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "He observed that he was not angry with Mitya for having knocked him down and struck him on the face; he had forgiven him long ago, he said.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "the old man caught him, stopped him and was felled to the ground by the brass pestle.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "His first compromising exclamations he hastened to explain by declaring that he was responsible for the death of the servant Grigory only.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch089", "global_index": 89, "label_ko": "12편 10장", "quote": "The prisoner, running away in the garden in the dark, climbed over the fence, was seized by the servant, and knocked him down with a brass pestle.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Captain Snegiryov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">29</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch somehow lost his temper with this captain, seized him by the beard and dragged him out into the street and for some distance along it", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch030", "global_index": 30, "label_ko": "4편 6장", "quote": "he attacked me as the brother of your assailant.... Now I understand it,", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "On being asked about Mitya’s attack upon him, he refused to answer. “God bless him. Ilusha told me not to.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lake Street" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">30</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch030", "global_index": 30, "label_ko": "4편 6장", "quote": "his brother Dmitri lived close by, in a turning out of Lake Street.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "Ivan Fyodorovitch sent me first thing this morning to your brother’s lodging in Lake Street", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Smerdyakov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">33</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "Twice already he’s threatened me with death.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 8}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch kept persisting every day, ‘You are deceiving me, you are hiding something from me! I’ll break both your legs for you.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "It’s Smerdyakov, that’s clear, now!", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "He used violent language, accused Smerdyakov, and was fearfully muddled.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lyagavy" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">47</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "No, you show me this: you tell me the law that allows roguery. D’you hear? You’re a scoundrel! Do you understand that?” Mitya stepped back gloomily", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "that night when I was having all that bother with Lyagavy, and afterwards yesterday, all day yesterday, I remember, till that happened ...", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Madame Hohlakov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">48</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "“Oh, the devil!” roared Mitya, and with all his might brought his fist down on the table. “Aie! Aie!” cried Madame Hohlakov, alarmed, and she flew to the other end of the drawing-room.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "He ran out in a fury, stamping. He rushed at me, but I slipped away.... And let me tell you, as I wish to hide nothing from you now, that he positively spat at me.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Madame Hohlakov" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">48</data>
  <data key="d8">5</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "“Three thousand? Roubles? Oh, no, I haven’t got three thousand,” Madame Hohlakov announced with serene amazement.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "Did she really give you three thousand? Did she really?” said Pyotr Ilyitch, eyeing him dubiously.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "I’ve never in my life lent to that unhappy man, Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov (for, in spite of all, he is unhappy), three thousand roubles to-day.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "went to Madame Hohlakov to borrow three thousand which she wouldn’t give me", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "or even on the security you offered to the merchant Samsonov, and to Madame Hohlakov?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Fenya" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">48</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "“You’re lying!” shouted Mitya. “From your terror I know where she is.” He rushed away.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "Mitya ran in, pounced on Fenya and seized her by the throat.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch057", "global_index": 57, "label_ko": "9편 4장", "quote": "“If I didn’t kill Fenya then, gentlemen, it was only because I hadn’t time,” broke from him suddenly at that point in his story.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Pyotr Ilyitch Perhotin" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">50</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "Just ten minutes later Dmitri went in to Pyotr Ilyitch Perhotin, the young official with whom he had pawned his pistols.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "At five o’clock this afternoon Dmitri Fyodorovitch borrowed ten roubles from me, and I know for a fact he had no money.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch057", "global_index": 57, "label_ko": "9편 4장", "quote": "the ten roubles you borrowed yesterday at about five o’clock on the security of your pistols, from your friend, Pyotr Ilyitch Perhotin.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "I was in want of ten roubles and pledged my pistols with Perhotin", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Pistols" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">48</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "He had a brace of fine dueling pistols in a case, which he had not pawned till then because he prized them above all his possessions.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch050", "global_index": 50, "label_ko": "8편 5장", "quote": "He put the pistols in the case, locked it up, and kept it in his hand.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "when only three hours earlier, on your own showing, you pledged your pistols for the sake of ten roubles!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Pan Vrublevsky" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">52</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch052", "global_index": 52, "label_ko": "8편 7장", "quote": "“You’re fools, you _panovie_,” broke suddenly from Mitya. “_Panie!_” shouted both the Poles, menacingly, setting on Mitya like a couple of cocks.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Andrey" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">52</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch052", "global_index": 52, "label_ko": "8편 7장", "quote": "“And vodka for Andrey, vodka for Andrey!” he cried in haste. “I was rude to Andrey!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "Mitya remembered Andrey again, and ordered punch to be sent out to him. “I was rude to him just now,” he repeated with a sinking, softened voice.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Pyotr Fomitch Kalganov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">53</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "“Leave off laughing at Poland,” said Kalganov sententiously.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">53</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "Ex-Lieutenant Karamazov, it is my duty to inform you that you are charged with the murder of your father, Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov, perpetrated this night....", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "“Good God! He must have killed his old father!” she cried, clasping her hands.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "At last the President opened the case of the murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov. I don’t quite remember how he described him. The court usher was told to bring in the prisoner", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">54</data>
  <data key="d8">12</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch054", "global_index": 54, "label_ko": "9편 1장", "quote": "“Good God! He must have killed his old father!” she cried, clasping her hands.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch055", "global_index": 55, "label_ko": "9편 2장", "quote": "direct confirmation, by a witness, of the theory held by all, as to the identity of the criminal", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "So you positively declare that you are not guilty of the death of your father, Fyodor Pavlovitch?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "and you absolutely deny all responsibility for the death of your father, was it not he, perhaps, who knocked the signal", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "“Agrafena Alexandrovna!” Mitya got up from his chair, “have faith in God and in me. I am not guilty of my father’s murder!”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "He came in shouting, ‘Money, money, three thousand! Give me three thousand!’ and then went away and immediately did the murder.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "She’s got a document in her hands, in Mitya’s own writing, that proves conclusively that he did murder Fyodor Pavlovitch.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "His chief feeling was one of relief at the fact that it was not Smerdyakov, but Mitya, who had committed the murder, though he might have been expected to feel the opposite.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "even if I’d been suspected, instead of Dmitri Fyodorovitch, or as his accomplice", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch086", "global_index": 86, "label_ko": "12편 7장", "quote": "And, in fact, from that letter we see that the whole fact of the murder was premeditated.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "for the last two months he has completely shared our conviction of his brother’s guilt", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "I thank the prosecutor, he told me many things about myself that I did not know; but it’s not true that I killed my father, the prosecutor is mistaken.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Mokroe" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">55</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch055", "global_index": 55, "label_ko": "9편 2장", "quote": "So they must make haste to Mokroe to find the criminal, before he really did shoot himself.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "I carried her off here to Mokroe then, and wasted here in two days half that damned three thousand", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "He had been in Mokroe more than once before, he had caroused there for two days together already, he knew the old big house with all its passages and outbuildings.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">56</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "I believe I’ve had the honor and pleasure of meeting you, Nikolay Parfenovitch, at my kinsman Miüsov’s.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Nikolay Parfenovitch Nelyudov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">58</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "“What! Undress? Ugh! Damn it! Won’t you search me as I am! Can’t you?” “It’s utterly impossible, Dmitri Fyodorovitch. You must take off your clothes.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "Mitya flew into a passion. “I won’t have other people’s clothes!” he shouted menacingly, “give me my own!” “It’s impossible!” “Give me my own. Damn Kalganov and his clothes, too!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch062", "global_index": 62, "label_ko": "9편 9장", "quote": "don’t be vexed with me for having shouted at you during the examination.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ippolit Kirillovitch" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">59</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "“Well, what now? Are you going to flog me? That’s all that’s left for you,” he said, clenching his teeth and addressing the prosecutor.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of Mitya's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">59</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "Can you suppose that I would conceal it from you, if I had really killed my father, that I would shuffle, lie, and hide myself?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "He wants to say ‘he couldn’t help murdering his father, he was corrupted by his environment,’ and so on.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "‘I am not guilty of my father’s death.’ That was his fence for the moment and behind it he hoped to throw up a barricade of some sort.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch089", "global_index": 89, "label_ko": "12편 10장", "quote": "And if he was capable of feeling grief and pity at having killed a man, it shows that he was innocent of his father’s murder.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Kuzma Kuzmitch Samsonov" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">60</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "or even on the security you offered to the merchant Samsonov, and to Madame Hohlakov?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Mussyalovitch" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">61</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "Mitya had tried to buy off Pan Mussyalovitch, and had offered him three thousand roubles to resign his claims", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "Only fancy, he is jealous of the Pole. ‘Why are you keeping him?’ he said. ‘So you’ve begun keeping him.’ He is jealous, jealous of me all the time, jealous eating and sleeping!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Mussyalovitch" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">61</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "Pan Mussyalovitch spoke proudly and warmly, so that Mitya was roused at once and declared that he would not allow the “scoundrel” to speak like that in his presence!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Three thousand roubles" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">18</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "So I had that three thousand roubles in my pocket when I went to see Grushenka, and it was that money we spent at Mokroe.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "the source from which you obtained the money which was so suddenly seen in your hands", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "had heard him tell several people that he had three thousand with him.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="carousal at Mokroe" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">61</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "three thousand roubles had certainly been spent on the first carousal at Mokroe", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "asking him about an incident at the first carousal at Mokroe, a month before the arrest", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov family" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">16</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch016", "global_index": 16, "label_ko": "3편 3장", "quote": "Has it reformed me? Never! For I’m a Karamazov. For when I do leap into the pit, I go headlong with my heels up", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch017", "global_index": 17, "label_ko": "3편 4장", "quote": "I loved cruelty; am I not a bug, am I not a noxious insect? In fact a Karamazov!", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch061", "global_index": 61, "label_ko": "9편 8장", "quote": "and he wanted to do it at once, at once, regardless of all obstacles, with all the recklessness of the Karamazovs.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "The Karamazovs are not blackguards, but philosophers; for all true Russians are philosophers", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch082", "global_index": 82, "label_ko": "12편 3장", "quote": "As an old resident in the town who had known the Karamazov family for years, he furnished some facts of great value for the prosecution", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "Because he was of the broad Karamazov character—that’s just what I am leading up to—capable of combining the most incongruous contradictions", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="The murder" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">70</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "prove that Mitya’s mad and committed the murder when he didn’t know what he was doing", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "hearing the details of the charge and the arrest, he was still more surprised at Alyosha", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "“Did the prisoner commit the murder for the sake of robbery and with premeditation?”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of Dmitri Fyodorovitch's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">72</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch072", "global_index": 72, "label_ko": "11편 3장", "quote": "Listen, your brother is being tried now for murdering his father and every one loves his having killed his father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Prison" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">73</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "A clever man knows his way about, but you’ve put your foot in it, committing a murder, and now you are rotting in prison.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Trial of Dmitri Karamazov" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">80</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "The court usher was told to bring in the prisoner, and Mitya made his appearance.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "Then the prisoner was allowed to speak. Mitya stood up, but said very little.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">53</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch053", "global_index": 53, "label_ko": "8편 8장", "quote": "Ex-Lieutenant Karamazov, it is my duty to inform you that you are charged with the murder of your father, Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov, perpetrated this night....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "At last the President opened the case of the murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Rakitin" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">73</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "I answered him, ‘Well, but you, without a God, are more likely to raise the price of meat, if it suits you, and make a rouble on every copeck.’ He lost his temper.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "Enraged by the tone in which Rakitin had referred to Grushenka, he suddenly shouted “Bernard!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch095", "global_index": 95, "label_ko": "13편 2장", "quote": "Rakitin had tried to force his way in twice, but Mitya persistently begged Varvinsky not to admit him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Arrest at Mokroe" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">83</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch083", "global_index": 83, "label_ko": "12편 4장", "quote": "“When the prisoner was arrested at Mokroe,” the prosecutor asked, “every one saw and heard you run out of the next room", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Brass pestle" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">87</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "having killed him, probably with one blow of the brass pestle, and having convinced himself, after careful search, that she was not there", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch089", "global_index": 89, "label_ko": "12편 10장", "quote": "that brass pestle which he had taken from the two women, and which they could always recognize afterwards as theirs, and prove that he had taken it from them.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Examination at Mokroe" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">88</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "When Ippolit Kirillovitch described how he had questioned and tortured him at Mokroe", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="murder of Mitya's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">73</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "He wants to say ‘he couldn’t help murdering his father, he was corrupted by his environment,’ and so on.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch089", "global_index": 89, "label_ko": "12편 10장", "quote": "And if he was capable of feeling grief and pity at having killed a man, it shows that he was innocent of his father’s murder.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Robbery of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">90</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "and that letter is the chief, the most stupendous proof of the prisoner having committed robbery!", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Trial of Mitya" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">82</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch082", "global_index": 82, "label_ko": "12편 3장", "quote": "“Bravo, doctor!” cried Mitya, from his seat, “just so!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "Then the prisoner was allowed to speak. Mitya stood up, but said very little.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="The trial" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">93</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch093", "global_index": 93, "label_ko": "12편 14장", "quote": "At that instant Mitya suddenly stood up and cried in a heartrending voice, stretching his hands out before him:", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Death of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">56</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "So you positively declare that you are not guilty of the death of your father, Fyodor Pavlovitch?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="The murder of Mitya's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">56</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "I’m struck all of a heap myself, for who can have murdered him, if not I? That’s what it comes to, isn’t it?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="The interrogation of Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">56</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "When the scene was over, he came to himself again, sitting in the same place as before, opposite the investigating lawyer", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Interrogation of Dmitri" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">60</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "“I have made you an awful confession,” Mitya said gloomily in conclusion.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Interrogation of Dmitri Fyodorovitch" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">60</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch060", "global_index": 60, "label_ko": "9편 7장", "quote": "We must pass to examining the witnesses without delay. That must be done in your presence and therefore—", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of Mitya's Father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">62</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch062", "global_index": 62, "label_ko": "9편 9장", "quote": "But listen, for the last time, I am not guilty of my father’s blood.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Kuzma" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">70</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "He even took it into his head to be jealous of Kuzma last week.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">73</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "I’ve never for one instant believed that you were the murderer!” broke in a shaking voice from Alyosha’s breast", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of his father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">76</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "This was the document of which Ivan spoke to Alyosha later on as a “conclusive proof” that Dmitri had killed his father.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="trial of Dmitri Karamazov" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">80</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "The court usher was told to bring in the prisoner, and Mitya made his appearance.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Crime" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">82</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch082", "global_index": 82, "label_ko": "12편 3장", "quote": "if the crime had been committed by him, it must, even if he were conscious of it, have been almost involuntary", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Questioning at Mokroe" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">88</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "When Ippolit Kirillovitch described how he had questioned and tortured him at Mokroe, Mitya raised his head and listened with intense curiosity.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="interrogation at Mokroe" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">88</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch088", "global_index": 88, "label_ko": "12편 9장", "quote": "When Ippolit Kirillovitch described how he had questioned and tortured him at Mokroe, Mitya raised his head and listened with intense curiosity.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of Alyosha's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">96</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch096", "global_index": 96, "label_ko": "13편 3장", "quote": "“Is your brother innocent or guilty? Was it he killed your father or was it the valet?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Agafya Ivanovna" id="OWES_MONEY_TO">
  <data key="d6">OWES_MONEY_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">18</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "Here is your three thousand; he sends it back. Send it yourself to Agafya Ivanovna. But he told me to say “he sends his compliments.”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Gorstkin" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">47</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "He roused him with a sort of ferocity, pulled at him, pushed him, even beat him; but after five minutes of vain exertions, he returned to his bench in helpless despair, and sat down.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Suhoy Possyolok" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">47</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch047", "global_index": 47, "label_ko": "8편 2장", "quote": "I’ll pay you for the light,” he said to the forester, “for the night’s lodging, too; you’ll remember Dmitri Karamazov.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Pistol" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">51</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch051", "global_index": 51, "label_ko": "8편 6장", "quote": "the paper was lying there in his pocket, ready; the pistol was loaded; he had already resolved how, next morning, he would meet the first warm ray", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="murder and robbing of Mitya's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">58</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch058", "global_index": 58, "label_ko": "9편 5장", "quote": "The answer to the question where I got the money would expose me to far greater disgrace than the murder and robbing of my father, if I had murdered and robbed him.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Murder of Dmitri's father" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">59</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch059", "global_index": 59, "label_ko": "9편 6장", "quote": "On the one hand we have the evidence of the open door from which you ran out, a fact which overwhelms you and us.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "This was the document of which Ivan spoke to Alyosha later on as a “conclusive proof” that Dmitri had killed his father.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">25</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "He was married twice, and had three sons, the eldest, Dmitri, by his first wife, and two, Ivan and Alexey, by his second.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Yet she bore Fyodor Pavlovitch two sons, Ivan and Alexey, the eldest in the first year of marriage and the second three years later.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "his brother Ivan was in his twenty-fourth year at the time, while their elder brother Dmitri was twenty-seven.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "He more quickly made friends with his half-brother Dmitri (though he arrived later) than with his own brother Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "What seemed to him strangest of all was that his brother Ivan, on whom alone he had rested his hopes, and who alone had such influence on his father that he could have stopped him", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "I’ve suspected that for a long time, brother, that’s why you don’t like my brother Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch021", "global_index": 21, "label_ko": "3편 8장", "quote": "“But she was my mother, too, I believe, his mother. Was she not?” said Ivan, with uncontrolled anger and contempt.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "“Brother, how will all this horror end between father and Dmitri?” exclaimed Alyosha.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch023", "global_index": 23, "label_ko": "3편 10장", "quote": "Ivan had made a step towards him, which was what Alyosha had been long desiring.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "On the way he remembered that his father had insisted the day before that he should come without his brother Ivan seeing him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "not that dreadful brother who was so shocking yesterday, but the other, Ivan Fyodorovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "by the side of two such friends as you and your brother I still feel strong—for I know—you two will never desert me.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch032", "global_index": 32, "label_ko": "5편 1장", "quote": "“I don’t like your brother Ivan, Alyosha,” said Lise suddenly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "On the other hand, Ivan Fyodorovitch sent me first thing this morning to your brother’s lodging in Lake Street, without a letter,", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "There’s such a difference between fifteen and eleven that brothers are never companions at those ages.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch035", "global_index": 35, "label_ko": "5편 4장", "quote": "“By the way, a Bulgarian I met lately in Moscow,” Ivan went on, seeming not to hear his brother’s words", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 9}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "He fancied besides that his brother was looking at him ironically.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "neither Dmitri Fyodorovitch nor yourself and your brother, Alexey Fyodorovitch, would have anything after the master’s death", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "If your little brother Ivan could see this—wouldn’t he be surprised! By the way, your brother Ivan set off to Moscow this morning, did you know?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "I can’t trust my daughter so easily to your brother Ivan Fyodorovitch, though I still consider him the most chivalrous young man.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "“What of brother Ivan?” interrupted Alyosha, but Mitya did not hear.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "mounting the staircase, which was dimly lighted by a Chinese lantern, he saw a man coming down, and as they met, he recognized him as his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "his share of the inheritance would come to you and your brother Alexey Fyodorovitch in equal parts", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch078", "global_index": 78, "label_ko": "11편 9장", "quote": "Alyosha, I told you not to come,\" he cried fiercely to his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "“He has worn you out,” said Alyosha, looking compassionately at his brother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">34</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "But there’s one Russian boy called Alyosha I am awfully fond of.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "Is that enough for you? Take it as a declaration of love if you like.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "I love your face, Alyosha. Did you know that I loved your face?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">38</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "He even hated Alyosha, recalling the conversation he had just had with him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "I break off all relations with you from this moment and probably for ever.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch078", "global_index": 78, "label_ko": "11편 9장", "quote": "When you flew out at Alyosha under the lamp-post this evening and shouted to him, ‘You learnt it from _him_! How do you know that _he_ visits me?’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">16</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Ivan had come partly at the request of, and in the interests of, his elder brother, Dmitri, whom he saw for the first time on this very visit", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "his brother Ivan was in his twenty-fourth year at the time, while their elder brother Dmitri was twenty-seven.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "not that dreadful brother who was so shocking yesterday, but the other, Ivan Fyodorovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "Ivan Fyodorovitch sent me first thing this morning to your brother’s lodging in Lake Street, without a letter, but with a message to Dmitri Fyodorovitch", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "Am I my brother Dmitri’s keeper?” Ivan snapped irritably", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "Grushenka had come on the scene, and there had been the scandals with his brother Dmitri—they discussed that, too.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch048", "global_index": 48, "label_ko": "8편 3장", "quote": "he heard with interest, too, that his brother Ivan had set off that morning for Moscow.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "No, it’s not Rakitin; it’s his brother Ivan Fyodorovitch upsetting him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch073", "global_index": 73, "label_ko": "11편 4장", "quote": "“What of brother Ivan?” interrupted Alyosha, but Mitya did not hear.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "By the way, let us say a word or two of Ivan’s feeling to his brother Dmitri.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "if you wanted the same as your brother, then the business was as good as settled and I should be crushed like a fly, too.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "“Listen. Did you kill him alone? With my brother’s help or without?”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "he wanted to save his brother and he confessed.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch084", "global_index": 84, "label_ko": "12편 5장", "quote": "It was he, not my brother, killed our father.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "The charge is confirmed by three persons only—the two brothers of the prisoner and Madame Svyetlov.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch094", "global_index": 94, "label_ko": "13편 1장", "quote": "not Dmitri Fyodorovitch, but the man lying the other side of that door, who has sacrificed himself for his brother", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RIVAL_OF">
  <data key="d6">RIVAL_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "He’s trying to get Mitya’s betrothed for himself, and I fancy he’ll succeed, too.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "As for Ivan, I can understand how he must be cursing nature now—with his intellect, too! To see the preference given—to whom, to what?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "He is doing his utmost to carry off Mitya’s betrothed. That’s what he is staying here for", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "Meantime, Dmitri had said outright on the previous day that he was glad that Ivan was his rival, and that it was a great assistance to him, Dmitri.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "Do you imagine I am jealous of Dmitri, that I’ve been trying to steal his beautiful Katerina Ivanovna for the last three months?", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "She thinks that I am ruining Mitya from jealousy on her account! Yes, she thinks that! But it’s not so.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">29</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "“One reptile will devour the other,” Ivan had pronounced the day before, speaking in anger of his father and Dmitri.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov family" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">11</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "“Here he is, going to the dinner as though nothing had happened,” he thought. “A brazen face, and the conscience of a Karamazov!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "If even you are a sensualist at heart, what of your brother, Ivan? He’s a Karamazov, too.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "which justifies me in speaking rather openly of him now, of course, not as an individual, but as a member of the Karamazov family.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "He’ll carry off Katerina Ivanovna, for whom he is languishing, and pocket her dowry of sixty thousand.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch018", "global_index": 18, "label_ko": "3편 5장", "quote": "Yes, Ivan fell in love with her; he’s in love with her still. I know that.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch026", "global_index": 26, "label_ko": "4편 2장", "quote": "He is doing his utmost to carry off Mitya's betrothed. That's what he is staying here for,", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch029", "global_index": 29, "label_ko": "4편 5장", "quote": "During the preceding month it had been several times suggested to him that his brother Ivan was in love with Katerina Ivanovna, and, what was more, that he meant “to carry her off” from Dmitri.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 7}, {"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "I fell in love with the young lady, I worried myself over her and she worried me.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "A week ago he suddenly told me that Ivan was in love with Katerina, because he often goes to see her.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "On his return from Moscow, he abandoned himself hopelessly to his mad and consuming passion for Katerina Ivanovna.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "And just at that time his relations with Katerina Ivanovna became acutely strained. They were like two enemies in love with one another.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">79</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "Katya despises me. I’ve seen that for a month past.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch094", "global_index": 94, "label_ko": "13편 1장", "quote": "we began quarreling about it at once and quarreled for three days.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Maximov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">13</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "Ivan, who had by now taken his seat, without a word gave Maximov a violent punch in the breast and sent him flying.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">13</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "“You’ve talked rot enough. You might rest a bit now,” Ivan snapped sullenly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "Meeting Fyodor Pavlovitch in the drawing-room directly he went in, he shouted to him, waving his hands, “I am going upstairs to my room, not in to you. Good-by!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazovs' house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "But at the time of our story there was no one living in the house but Fyodor Pavlovitch and his son Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Smerdyakov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">33</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "But he said I was a stinking lackey. He thinks that I might be unruly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "“Damn you! Speak out what you want!” Ivan cried angrily at last, passing from meekness to violence.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 8}, {"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "he loathed the valet as one who had insulted him more gravely than any one in the world.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "“You are cunning with me, damn you!” he exclaimed, getting angry.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "Ivan jumped up and struck him with all his might on the shoulder, so that he fell back against the wall.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "Ivan jumped up and seized him by the shoulder. “Tell me everything, you viper! Tell me everything!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Smerdyakov" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">77</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "That was quite right what you taught me, for you talked a lot to me about that.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch085", "global_index": 85, "label_ko": "12편 6장", "quote": "Everything in the world is lawful according to him, and nothing must be forbidden in the future—that is what he always taught me.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazovs" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">34</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "It’s a feature of the Karamazovs, it’s true, that thirst for life regardless of everything;", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "The strength of the Karamazovs—the strength of the Karamazov baseness.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Masons" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">36</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "“You are perhaps a Mason yourself!” broke suddenly from Alyosha.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch’s house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "And here the young man was staying in the house of such a father, had been living with him for two months, and they were on the best possible terms.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "And Ivan, on parting from Alyosha, went home to Fyodor Pavlovitch’s house.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Moscow" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">34</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch034", "global_index": 34, "label_ko": "5편 3장", "quote": "When I went away to Moscow for the first few years I never thought of you at all.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch038", "global_index": 38, "label_ko": "5편 7장", "quote": "he announced that he was starting off in an hour to return to Moscow for good, and begged him to send for the horses.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch078", "global_index": 78, "label_ko": "11편 9장", "quote": "I was seventeen then, I was at the high school. I made up that anecdote and told it to a schoolfellow called Korovkin, it was at Moscow....", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Rakitin" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">12</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "the day before yesterday at Katerina Ivanovna’s he was abusing me for all he was worth—you see what an interest he takes", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "Your brother Ivan declared once that I was a ‘liberal booby with no talents whatsoever.’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Mitya's letter to Katerina Ivanovna" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">76</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch076", "global_index": 76, "label_ko": "11편 7장", "quote": "When Ivan read this “document” he was convinced. So then it was his brother, not Smerdyakov.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">74</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "You have accused yourself and have confessed to yourself that you are the murderer and no one else.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "I want to prove to your face this evening that you are the only real murderer in the whole affair", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">90</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch090", "global_index": 90, "label_ko": "12편 11장", "quote": "He had spoken of it to the prisoner and his brother, Ivan Fyodorovitch, before the catastrophe.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "the equally startling evidence given in court to-day by the elder of the prisoner’s brothers, who had believed in his guilt", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="3000 Roubles" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">91</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "the elder of the prisoner’s brothers, who had believed in his guilt, but has to-day produced a bundle of notes and proclaimed Smerdyakov as the murderer.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Katerina Ivanovna's house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">94</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch094", "global_index": 94, "label_ko": "13편 1장", "quote": "Katerina Ivanovna had immediately after the scene at the trial ordered the sick and unconscious man to be carried to her house", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="The Karamazovs' house" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "there was no one living in the house but Fyodor Pavlovitch and his son Ivan.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Alexei Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">36</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch036", "global_index": 36, "label_ko": "5편 5장", "quote": "He fancied besides that his brother was looking at him ironically.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch075", "global_index": 75, "label_ko": "11편 6장", "quote": "Alyosha turned rather pale, and looked silently into his brother’s face.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan's lodge" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">74</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch074", "global_index": 74, "label_ko": "11편 5장", "quote": "Ivan lived some distance from him. He had taken a roomy and fairly comfortable lodge attached to a fine house", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Ivan's House" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">77</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch077", "global_index": 77, "label_ko": "11편 8장", "quote": "Just as he reached his own house he stopped short, asking himself suddenly hadn’t he better go at once to the prosecutor and tell him everything.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Devil" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">78</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch078", "global_index": 78, "label_ko": "11편 9장", "quote": "“Fool!” Ivan snapped out. “But you are clever, anyway. You are scolding again?", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" target="Lise" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">79</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch079", "global_index": 79, "label_ko": "11편 10장", "quote": "I like Lise. I said something nasty about her. It was a lie. I like her", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adelaïda Ivanovna" target="Miüsovs" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "Fyodor Pavlovitch’s first wife, Adelaïda Ivanovna, belonged to a fairly rich and distinguished noble family, also landowners in our district, the Miüsovs.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adelaïda Ivanovna" target="Petersburg" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "The poor woman turned out to be in Petersburg, where she had gone with her divinity student, and where she had thrown herself into a life of complete emancipation.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adelaïda Ivanovna" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "rumor had it that Fyodor Pavlovitch did not beat his wife but was beaten by her, for she was a hot-tempered, bold, dark-browed, impatient woman", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "but for the first, Adelaïda Ivanovna, who used to thrash him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Death of Adelaïda Ivanovna" target="Petersburg" id="OCCURRED_AT">
  <data key="d6">OCCURRED_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch001", "global_index": 1, "label_ko": "1편 1장", "quote": "And just at that time his wife’s family received the news of her death in Petersburg.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">5</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "a faithful servant of the family, Grigory, took the three-year-old Mitya into his care.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "When Adelaïda Ivanovna had run away, Grigory took Dmitri, then a child of three years old, combed his hair and washed him in a tub with his own hands, and looked after him for almost a year.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "“I used to wash him in his tub. He’s insulted me,” repeated Grigory.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch056", "global_index": 56, "label_ko": "9편 3장", "quote": "That old man used to carry me in his arms, gentlemen. He used to wash me in the tub when I was a baby three years old, abandoned by every one, he was like a father to me!...", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "He’d have been devoured by lice when he was little, if it hadn’t been for me,” he added, describing Mitya’s early childhood.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="SERVANT_OF">
  <data key="d6">SERVANT_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">13</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "a faithful servant of the family, Grigory, took the three-year-old Mitya into his care.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Grigory, the gloomy, stupid, obstinate, argumentative servant, who had always hated his first mistress, Adelaïda Ivanovna, took the side of his new mistress.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "And, if it had not been for the same servant Grigory, who by that time had aged considerably too", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "They did not go away, and Fyodor Pavlovitch promised them a small sum for wages, and paid it regularly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch015", "global_index": 15, "label_ko": "3편 2장", "quote": "At the time, Grigory stood up for his master vigorously. He provoked quarrels and altercations in defense of him and succeeded in bringing some people round to his side.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch019", "global_index": 19, "label_ko": "3편 6장", "quote": "The servants, Grigory and Smerdyakov, were standing by.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch021", "global_index": 21, "label_ko": "3편 8장", "quote": "“Get along with you, Jesuits!” he cried to the servants. “Go away, Smerdyakov. I’ll send you the gold piece I promised you to-day, but be off! Don’t cry, Grigory.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch022", "global_index": 22, "label_ko": "3편 9장", "quote": "They had been struggling with him in the passage, refusing to admit him, acting on instructions given them by Fyodor Pavlovitch some days before.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch037", "global_index": 37, "label_ko": "5편 6장", "quote": "I should never dare to tell Grigory Vassilyevitch about the signals without orders from my master.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch049", "global_index": 49, "label_ko": "8편 4장", "quote": "glancing to the left he saw his master’s window open. No one was looking out of it then.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch055", "global_index": 55, "label_ko": "9편 2장", "quote": "though Fyodor Pavlovitch had for the last week locked himself in every night and did not allow even Grigory to come in on any pretext.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch081", "global_index": 81, "label_ko": "12편 2장", "quote": "So, for instance, when Grigory, Fyodor Pavlovitch’s old servant, who had given the most damning piece of evidence about the open door, was examined", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch087", "global_index": 87, "label_ko": "12편 8장", "quote": "then his servant, Grigory, but he was almost killed himself;", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "He championed her cause, abusing Fyodor Pavlovitch in a manner little befitting a servant, and on one occasion broke up the revels and drove all the disorderly women out of the house.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "They were looked after by the same Grigory and lived in his cottage, where they were found by the tyrannical old lady who had brought up their mother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Afterwards he had looked after Ivan and Alyosha, for which the general’s widow had rewarded him with a slap in the face; but I have already related all that.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "They were looked after by the same Grigory and lived in his cottage, where they were found by the tyrannical old lady who had brought up their mother.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Afterwards he had looked after Ivan and Alyosha, for which the general’s widow had rewarded him with a slap in the face; but I have already related all that.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="The lodge" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "And in the lodge there were only three servants: old Grigory, and his old wife Marfa, and a young man called Smerdyakov.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Marfa Ignatyevna" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "It was impossible to tell at first sight whether he loved his meek, obedient wife; but he really did love her, and she knew it.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Marfa Ignatyevna" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Grigory saw how his wife danced, and, an hour later, at home in their cottage he gave her a lesson, pulling her hair a little.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Marfa Ignatyevna" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Going back into the house, Grigory lighted a lantern, took the garden key, and taking no notice of the hysterical fears of his wife", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Adelaïda Ivanovna" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "I have mentioned already that Grigory had detested Adelaïda Ivanovna, the first wife of Fyodor Pavlovitch and the mother of Dmitri", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Smerdyakov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">19</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch019", "global_index": 19, "label_ko": "3편 6장", "quote": "He was brought up by Grigory and Marfa, but the boy grew up “with no sense of gratitude,”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "He was disrespectful to the servant Grigory and his wife, who had cared for him in his childhood.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Smerdyakov" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">19</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch019", "global_index": 19, "label_ko": "3편 6장", "quote": "Grigory taught him to read and write, and when he was twelve years old, began teaching him the Scriptures.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Smerdyakov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">19</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch019", "global_index": 19, "label_ko": "3편 6장", "quote": "“I’ll show you where!” he cried, and gave the boy a violent slap on the cheek.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch020", "global_index": 20, "label_ko": "3편 7장", "quote": "“He’s a rascal, that’s what he is!” burst from Grigory. He looked Smerdyakov wrathfully in the face.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch033", "global_index": 33, "label_ko": "5편 2장", "quote": "Grigory Vassilyevitch blames me for rebelling against my birth, but I would have sanctioned their killing me before I was born", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="ACCUSED_OF">
  <data key="d6">ACCUSED_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">71</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "Yes, I know it was that old man Grigory murdered him.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">91</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch091", "global_index": 91, "label_ko": "12편 12장", "quote": "at that moment when the old Grigory shouted at the top of his voice ‘Parricide!’", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Birth of Lizaveta's child" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">14</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch014", "global_index": 14, "label_ko": "3편 1장", "quote": "Opening the door of the bath-house, he saw a sight which petrified him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grigory" target="Grushenka" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">70</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch070", "global_index": 70, "label_ko": "11편 1장", "quote": "I went and talked to him myself. He’s rude about it, too.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Adelaïda Ivanovna" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "a cousin of Mitya’s mother, Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov, happened to return from Paris.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "Mitya did, in fact, pass into this cousin’s keeping, but as the latter had no family of his own", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "a cousin of Mitya’s mother, Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov, happened to return from Paris.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Paris" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "settling permanently in Paris he, too, forgot the child, especially when the Revolution of February broke out", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "He had come from Paris, which was his permanent home.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch010", "global_index": 10, "label_ko": "2편 5장", "quote": "Some years ago, soon after the _coup d’état_ of December, I happened to be calling in Paris on an extremely influential personage in the Government", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch080", "global_index": 80, "label_ko": "12편 1장", "quote": "Four of the witnesses were not present—Miüsov, who had given evidence at the preliminary inquiry, but was now in Paris;", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Paris Revolution of February 1848" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">2</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch002", "global_index": 2, "label_ko": "1편 2장", "quote": "describing the three days of the Paris Revolution of February 1848, hinting that he himself had almost taken part in the fighting on the barricades.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov, of whom we have spoken already, the cousin of Fyodor Pavlovitch’s first wife, happened to be in the neighborhood", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "“I am not your relative and never have been, you contemptible man!”", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "You stung him by what you said about family harmony, Father Superior, he does not admit he is my relation.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">6</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch006", "global_index": 6, "label_ko": "2편 1장", "quote": "“Fyodor Pavlovitch, for the last time, your compact, do you hear? Behave properly or I will pay you out!” Miüsov had time to mutter again.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "“Fyodor Pavlovitch, this is unbearable! You know you’re telling lies and that that stupid anecdote isn’t true. Why are you playing the fool?” cried Miüsov in a shaking voice.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "“I am not your relative and never have been, you contemptible man!”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch013", "global_index": 13, "label_ko": "2편 8장", "quote": "He felt that he ought to have disdained that despicable wretch, Fyodor Pavlovitch, too much to have been upset by him in Father Zossima’s cell, and so to have forgotten himself.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">10</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch010", "global_index": 10, "label_ko": "2편 5장", "quote": "He had had intellectual encounters with Ivan before and he could not endure a certain carelessness Ivan showed him.", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch011", "global_index": 11, "label_ko": "2편 6장", "quote": "Miüsov looked with hatred at Ivan. “Here he is, going to the dinner as though nothing had happened,” he thought.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Pyotr Fomitch Kalganov" id="RELATED_TO">
  <data key="d6">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d7">6</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch006", "global_index": 6, "label_ko": "2편 1장", "quote": "First an elegant open carriage, drawn by two valuable horses, drove up with Miüsov and a distant relative of his, a young man of twenty, called Pyotr Fomitch Kalganov.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pyotr Alexandrovitch Miüsov" target="Father Païssy" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">10</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch010", "global_index": 10, "label_ko": "2편 5장", "quote": "“Why, it’s beyond anything!” cried Miüsov, suddenly breaking out; “the State is eliminated and the Church is raised to the position of the State.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Yefim Petrovitch Polenov" target="Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "And to Yefim Petrovitch, a man of a generosity and humanity rarely to be met with, the young people were more indebted for their education and bringing up than to any one.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Yefim Petrovitch Polenov" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="RAISED">
  <data key="d6">RAISED</data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch003", "global_index": 3, "label_ko": "1편 3장", "quote": "And to Yefim Petrovitch, a man of a generosity and humanity rarely to be met with, the young people were more indebted for their education and bringing up than to any one.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "When he entered the household of his patron and benefactor, Yefim Petrovitch Polenov, he gained the hearts of all the family, so that they looked on him quite as their own child.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">4</data>
  <data key="d8">15</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "he found in it at that time, as he thought, an extraordinary being, our celebrated elder, Zossima, to whom he became attached", "disputed": true, "n_passes": 5}, {"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "Alyosha lived in the cell of the elder, who was very fond of him and let him wait upon him.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 6}, {"doc_id": "ch012", "global_index": 12, "label_ko": "2편 7장", "quote": "This is my last message to you: in sorrow seek happiness. Work, work unceasingly.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch024", "global_index": 24, "label_ko": "3편 11장", "quote": "Understand, Alexey, that if you return to the world, it must be to do the duty laid upon you by your elder, and not for frivolous vanity and worldly pleasures.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch025", "global_index": 25, "label_ko": "4편 1장", "quote": "“I’ve been teaching you so many years, and therefore I’ve been talking aloud so many years, that I’ve got into the habit of talking", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 9}, {"doc_id": "ch028", "global_index": 28, "label_ko": "4편 4장", "quote": "and Father Zossima tells me I must marry.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch030", "global_index": 30, "label_ko": "4편 6장", "quote": "And Father Zossima sent me to reconcile and bring them together.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch032", "global_index": 32, "label_ko": "5편 1장", "quote": "my elder told me once to care for most people exactly as one would for children, and for some of them as one would for the sick in hospitals.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch035", "global_index": 35, "label_ko": "5편 4장", "quote": "You are dear to me, I don’t want to let you go, and I won’t give you up to your Zossima.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "or whether he added to it his notes of parts of former conversations with his teacher, I cannot determine.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch042", "global_index": 42, "label_ko": "7편 1장", "quote": "cast a strange, very strange, look at the Father to whom his former guide, the former sovereign of his heart and mind, his beloved elder, had confided him as he lay dying.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch043", "global_index": 43, "label_ko": "7편 2장", "quote": "what he saw before all was one figure—the figure of his beloved elder, the figure of that holy man whom he revered with such adoration.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch044", "global_index": 44, "label_ko": "7편 3장", "quote": "His elder died to-day, Father Zossima, the saint.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch045", "global_index": 45, "label_ko": "7편 4장", "quote": "Within three days he left the monastery in accordance with the words of his elder, who had bidden him “sojourn in the world.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch071", "global_index": 71, "label_ko": "11편 2장", "quote": "Another contradicted this, and stated that he and his elder, Father Zossima, had broken into the monastery chest and “made tracks from the monastery.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Alexey Fyodorovitch Karamazov" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "Many times I’ve seen in your face as it were a look of mortification that I love Alexey more than you.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Monastery Hermitage" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">4</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch004", "global_index": 4, "label_ko": "1편 4장", "quote": "the elder Zossima, who was living in the monastery hermitage", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Caucasus" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">5</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch005", "global_index": 5, "label_ko": "1편 5장", "quote": "had been in the army in early youth, and served in the Caucasus as an officer.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="the Hermitage" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">6</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch006", "global_index": 6, "label_ko": "2편 1장", "quote": "“Father Zossima lives in the hermitage, apart, four hundred paces from the monastery, the other side of the copse.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="the Hermitage" id="OCCURRED_AT">
  <data key="d6">OCCURRED_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">6</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch006", "global_index": 6, "label_ko": "2편 1장", "quote": "“Father Zossima lives in the hermitage, apart, four hundred paces from the monastery, the other side of the copse.”", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}, {"doc_id": "ch041", "global_index": 41, "label_ko": "6편 3장", "quote": "The news of his death spread at once through the hermitage and reached the monastery.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}, {"doc_id": "ch042", "global_index": 42, "label_ko": "7편 1장", "quote": "by three o’clock those signs had become so clear and unmistakable, that the news swiftly reached all the monks and visitors in the hermitage", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov" id="MENTOR_OF">
  <data key="d6">MENTOR_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">7</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch007", "global_index": 7, "label_ko": "2편 2장", "quote": "Father Zossima, lifting his eyes, looked at him, and said with a smile: “You have known for a long time what you must do. You have sense enough: don’t give way to drunkenness", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Elder's Cell" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">10</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch010", "global_index": 10, "label_ko": "2편 5장", "quote": "The elder’s absence from his cell had lasted for about twenty-five minutes.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Markel" id="BROTHER_OF">
  <data key="d6">BROTHER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "There were two of us, my elder brother Markel and I.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 4}, {"doc_id": "ch040", "global_index": 40, "label_ko": "6편 2장", "quote": "And then I remembered my brother Markel and what he said on his death-bed to his servants", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Porfiry" id="LOVES">
  <data key="d6">LOVES</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "Now you know why that was so, but I love you too, know that, and many times I grieved at your mortification.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="V." id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "I was born in a distant province in the north, in the town of V.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Kostroma" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "when Father Zossima first began his life as a monk in a poor and little monastery at Kostroma", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="A Hundred and Four Stories from the Old and New Testament" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "I had a book of Scripture history then with excellent pictures, called _A Hundred and Four Stories from the Old and New Testament_, and I learned to read from it.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Cadet Corps" id="MEMBER_OF">
  <data key="d6">MEMBER_OF</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "She brought me to Petersburg and put me into the Cadet Corps, and I never saw her again.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Afanasy Pavlovitch" id="QUARRELS_WITH">
  <data key="d6">QUARRELS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d7">40</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch040", "global_index": 40, "label_ko": "6편 2장", "quote": "I flew into a rage with my orderly Afanasy, and gave him two blows in the face with all my might, so that it was covered with blood.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="The Bible" id="POSSESSES">
  <data key="d6">POSSESSES</data>
  <data key="d7">40</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch040", "global_index": 40, "label_ko": "6편 2장", "quote": "the Bible was the one book I never opened at that time, though I always carried it about with me, and I was never separated from it", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 3}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="The Duel" id="PRESENT_AT">
  <data key="d6">PRESENT_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">40</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch040", "global_index": 40, "label_ko": "6편 2장", "quote": "So we reached the place and found them there, waiting us. We were placed twelve paces apart; he had the first shot.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Petersburg" id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">39</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch039", "global_index": 39, "label_ko": "6편 1장", "quote": "She brought me to Petersburg and put me into the Cadet Corps, and I never saw her again.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 2}, {"doc_id": "ch040", "global_index": 40, "label_ko": "6편 2장", "quote": "I spent a long time, almost eight years, in the military cadet school at Petersburg", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Father Zossima" target="Town of K." id="LIVES_AT">
  <data key="d6">LIVES_AT</data>
  <data key="d7">40</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">[{"doc_id": "ch040", "global_index": 40, "label_ko": "6편 2장", "quote": "After four years of this life, I chanced to be in the town of K. where our regiment was stationed at the time.", "disputed": false, "n_passes": 1}]</data>
</edge>
